UID:paros-naoussa-klidonas-bonfires-of-agios-ioannis-naoussa-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270623
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270625
SUMMARY:Klidonas bonfires of Agios Ioannis\, Naoussa
LOCATION:Naoussa\, Paros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On the evening of 23 June the harbour of Naoussa (and\, smaller\, Aliki and Prodromos) lights the Klidonas bonfires: the dried May wreaths go on the fire\, kids and the local dance group jump over it\, and the cultural association hands out meze and wine with violin and laouto. It is a short\, early-summer event rather than an all-nighter\, so turn up around 21:00 and stay for the dancing on the quay.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/paros/#naoussa-klidonas-bonfires-of-agios-ioannis-naoussa
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/paros/#naoussa-klidonas-bonfires-of-agios-ioannis-naoussa
END:VEVENT
