BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:paros-marpissa-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-marpissa-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration (Sotiros)\, Marpissa
LOCATION:Marpissa\, Paros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Marpissa's parish church is dedicated to the Transfiguration\, so 5-6 August is the village's own feast: a bishop's liturgy on the day\, and the night before a panigiri in Papa-Giorgis Stamenas square with food\, wine and live island music. Aliki on the south coast holds a smaller Sotiros feast the same evening\, often with a fish festival on the beach. Marpissa's lanes are car-free\; park at the entrance by the main road.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/paros/#marpissa-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-marpissa
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/paros/#marpissa-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-marpissa
END:VEVENT
