DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Dormition at Panagia Ekatontapyliani\, Parikia
LOCATION:Parikia\, Paros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Procession of the icon from the Church of Ekatontapyliani in Parikia\, one of the oldest standing churches in Greece (4th century). Major all-island festival.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/paros/#parikia-dormition-at-panagia-ekatontapyliani-parikia
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/paros/#parikia-dormition-at-panagia-ekatontapyliani-parikia
